      <activity id="8d020506-b7f0-5ae3-9ed1-22e5590553fb" activityNameId="300f001b-c9af-55aa-b8e5-7003dfbef8f7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyethylene, HDPE, granulate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyethylene, HDPE, granulate, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=6738f024-eb64-3ef8-837e-05b84c6e43da
All processes are considererd including waste treatment of process waste
Location: EU27 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The polymer process, upstream processes like ethylene production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2011 with the methane emission updates in 2023
Production volume: referring to covered HDPE production (68.3 % of 6,720 kt in 2011)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by PlasticEurope member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6738f024-eb64-3ef8-837e-05b84c6e43da.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
